Package: com.wjf.pin120
Name: Pin120
Version: 2.7.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Keeps ProMotion pinned at 120Hz in games on iPad Pro (2018/A12X). Forces UIScreen.maximumFramesPerSecond, CADisplayLink and Unity targetFrameRate to 120 and re-pins every display link once per second. Includes a load self-test (writes pin120.loaded.txt into the app container) and an in-game HUD.
Maintainer: wjf
Author: wjf
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)



